# Gemini / Google AI rules for Loon
# Updated: 2026-09-13
# Purpose: Gemini, Google AI Studio, NotebookLM, Jules, Labs, Flow, Stitch,
#          Opal, Antigravity and Google Gemini Code Assist related traffic.
# Loon: assign this Rule Set to AI_AUTO (or your Gemini-only policy).
# Design: explicit domains are preferred; no DOMAIN-REGEX dependency.
# Reference rule sources checked: blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script,
# SukkaW/Surge, v2fly/domain-list-community, rz6agx/iOS-Rule.
# Their URLs are listed in the accompanying response for traceability.
# Note: this list intentionally does not include the whole google.com,
#       googleapis.com, clients6.google.com or googleusercontent.com suffix.

# --- Gemini web / legacy Bard ---
DOMAIN,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bard.google.com
DOMAIN,gemini.gstatic.com

# --- Gemini frontend and realtime channels ---
# Google AI frequently uses changing <service>-pa.googleapis.com hosts.
# This narrow suffix catches new PA endpoints without proxying all googleapis.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,webchannel-robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,signaler-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aisandbox-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,optimizationguide-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,geller-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,assistant-s3-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,appcatalyst.pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,developerprofiles-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,phonedeviceverification-pa.googleapis.com

# --- Generative Language API ---
DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,gem-pa.googleapis.com

# --- Google AI Studio / MakerSuite ---
# Same pattern for Google AI Studio clients6 PA endpoints.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN,ai.studio
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativeai.google
DOMAIN,alkalicore-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,webchannel-alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,signaler-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,waa-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,people-pa.clients6.google.com

# --- NotebookLM ---
DOMAIN,notebook.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google.com
DOMAIN,notebooklm-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,notebooklm.googleapis.com

# --- Jules / Google AI Labs / Flow / Stitch / Opal ---
DOMAIN,jules.google
DOMAIN,jules.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,labs.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,labs.google.com
DOMAIN,flow.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stitch.withgoogle.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,opal.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,opal.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,opal.withgoogle.com

# --- Google DeepMind ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google

# --- Gemini Code Assist / Cloud Code / Android Studio ---
DOMAIN,cloudaicompanion.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aicode.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aida.googleapis.com

# --- Antigravity ---
DOMAIN,antigravity.google
DOMAIN,antigravity-unleash.goog
DOMAIN,antigravity-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,antigravity.googleapis.com

# --- Shared Google account / API / avatar endpoints used during Gemini login ---
# These are exact or narrow hosts, not the whole Google domain.
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,oauthaccountmanager.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,play.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,notifications-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,subscriptionsfirstparty-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,apis.google.com
DOMAIN,lh3.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,lh4.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,lh5.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,lh6.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,o.pki.goog

# --- Supporting keywords seen in maintained AI rule sets ---
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,generativelanguage
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,developerprofiles
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,colab

# --- Optional broad compatibility rules ---
# Enable only if Gemini login/redirect still fails and your policy should also
# carry ordinary Google web traffic. They are disabled deliberately because
# they can send Search, YouTube, Maps and unrelated Google services to AI_AUTO.
# DOMAIN,www.google.com
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clients6.google.com
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gstatic.com
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleusercontent.com
